      "id": "claim_c5678b41869e411c97cbb6def321723a",
      "statement": "update_resource and update_resource_status both query the resource's latest active PubResourceReview ordered by reviewed_at desc when status is rejected, and only permit edits or resubmission if that review's verdict equals ReviewVerdict.needs_revision; a hard rejected verdict is otherwise terminal for the normal edit/resubmit endpoints, and deleting a review resets the resource status back to pending_review.",
      "evidence": [
